{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ee972bfd-8021-8f3a-8d7a-bfbbe2fcc0cb",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:28:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivone Pina",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:25:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Good afternoon. Um, I am calling about a streetlight. The light on the pole, it stays on all day. Even now, in the afternoon, with the sun, it is still lit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a streetlight that's on during the day. Got it. Whereabouts is the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:25:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is in front of my building, 328 Chapel Street. In the Historic Hill, you know? The pole is by the sidewalk, near the front steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:25:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three twenty-eight Chapel. Okay, writing that down. And how long has it been staying on, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:25:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, let me think. I notice it, I think, since Monday. Yes, Monday morning I leave for work and it is on. Tuesday, the same. Today, the same. So it is burning the whole day and the whole night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:25:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha, so since Monday, on around the clock. Is it a regular light on a wooden pole, or a fancier fixture, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:26:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think it is a regular one, on a tall pole. The color is orange, a little yellow. Not so fancy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:26:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Any damage to the pole, anything hanging, leaning, buzzing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:26:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I don't see nothing like this. The pole looks normal. Only the light, it does not turn off. So I ask, please, if a crew can come and check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:26:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it. Pole check, light on all day, 328 Chapel Street. They'll get to it as they get through the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:26:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. That is good. [pause] Excuse me, one more thing, it is not about the light. Is okay if I ask?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:26:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead, if I can help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:26:49-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My job, they just change the schedule for the breaks. Now is different times, and I do not understand it well. Before I have the break at ten, and now they say something about a split, two short ones and one long. I am confused. I'm sorry, I know you are Public Works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:27:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. That one's out of my lane, though. That'd be a question for your supervisor or whoever handles scheduling at your employer. Maybe ask them to write it out for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:27:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, you are right. I will ask them to write it on paper. Thank you, Kevin. You are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:27:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Do you want a callback number on the streetlight ticket, in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:27:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, okay. It is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:27:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-one. Got it. And it's Ivone, right? How do you spell the last name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Ivone. Last name is Pina. P-I-N-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:27:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pina. Perfect. So that's the light on all day at 328 Chapel, crew to check the pole, and I've got your number. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:27:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is everything. Thank you very much. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T13:28:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ivone. Take care."
    }
  ],
